       public synchronized void increment() {
           count++;
       }

       public synchronized int getCount() {
           return count;
       }
   }
   ```

2. **Synchronized Methods**: A method can be declared as synchronized using the `synchronized` keyword. This ensures that only one thread can execute any synchronized method of a class at a time.

